sequenceDiagram
    participant ES as EventSystem
    participant F as OneTextInputField
    participant I as IImeInput
    participant M as TextEditingModel
    participant A as ImeCommitArbiter
    participant V as OneTextLabel and OneTextCaret
    ES->>F: OnUpdateSelected (every frame while selected)
    F->>F: UpdateEditing
    F->>F: ReleaseHeldBackspace (from the last update)
    F->>F: settle _reclaimIfNoKeyFollows
    F->>A: NoteComposing(live composition) if composing
    F->>I: TryGetComposition
    I-->>F: text, caret, clauseStart, clauseLength
    F->>M: SetComposition(...) only if the report differs
    F->>A: ReclaimedInto / NotePlatformReleased as the case requires
    F->>I: SetCursorScreenPosition(caret in screen px) if composing
    F->>M: Tick (grace window advances by one)
    loop Event.PopEvent until empty
        F->>F: ProcessKeyEvent(KeyDown)
        F->>M: Backspace / Insert / AcceptCharacter / SetCaret ...
    end
    F->>F: ReleaseHeldBackspace (end of update)
    F->>ES: eventData.Use
    Note over F,V: later the same frame
    F->>F: LateUpdate
    F->>V: UpdateVisuals if _visualsDirty, else UpdateCaretGeometry (blink)
